      "rules": "Two inputs. TEXT ENTRY (the God of Time interaction): send action.begin when you start typing (time slows for everyone: window.opened says who), then action.submit with the window_id and your orders to your hands in fields {left, right} (or text lines `l: …` / `r: …`); the initiator's submit (Enter) closes the window and cuts off everyone who hasn't submitted (a private `cut` reply). Time charges a bolt and a debt that grows with every second the window stays open. CASTS (god powers, any time, anywhere on the globe): action.submit with instant: true and fields.cast {power, target: ref | [lon, lat] | name} from `powers`, paid in lightning bolts at the next beat; everyone sees the streak at once; every bolt you spend gives every rival 2 and raises Entropy. Optional zoom {level: world|region|city|character, focus}. Last demigod standing wins.",
